A door becomes a lead the moment somebody answers it

A list of 150 addresses is a canvassing route, not a pipeline. Until now a
door that got knocked went straight back into the pool, and tomorrow's run
regenerated it as if nothing had been said.

Recording an outcome now PROMOTES the door into a record of its own, in its
own database, with the score and the reasons frozen as they stood at the
knock. It survives the next refresh, the next app update and a day offline.

Four numbers across the top - NEW, FOLLOW-UP, NEED VISIT, APPTS - and each
one is a list you can work. Not-home and come-back-later are counted
together, because both mean the same thing to a rep: that door is owed
another visit.

One tap at the door, because the alternative is a rep who stops recording by
the fourth house. The note and the time come after the tap, never before.

Nothing here claims more than the device saw. A call is recorded as PLACED
and a text as INITIATED, never as answered or delivered. Do-not-knock is
permanent and keeps that address off every future list.

